        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSBT, Solid Brass Ball Finial</b>\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Ball finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in an array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAll Deltana decorative finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with  <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinges\"><b>Deltana 3-1/2\" to 5\" Solid Brass Hinges</b></a> .\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Ball Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread: 8mm x 1.25mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ball Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSBT",
                "description": "Deltana DSBT Ball Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Ball cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in an array of finishes.",
